        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 1</p><hr /><p>This rod uses fin-shaped plates to become a greatpick, taking one action to reassemble itself with the breakdown trait.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Graviton Drag</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (attack, electricity)</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are trained with the maglock spine; <strong>Cost</strong> 5+ charges (maximum 5 for every weapon die)</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Attempt a melee Strike against the Reflex DC of a creature within 5 feet for every 5 charges spent to Activate this ability. On a success, the creature is pulled 5 feet closer to you for every 5 charges spent to Activate this ability. On a critical success, it's also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Suppressed] for 1 round. This attack deals no damage.</p>"
